# Heroes of Abyssea (abyssea 179): a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with A Journey Begins completed (no story quest
# past it: Joachim's script plays nothing) and An Ulcerous Uragnite accepted (GMs). Joachim (available, one of the
# three begun): 340, finished: begun. Joachim (accepted, none of the three completed): no section: nothing (his script:
# Dawn of Death not accepted). An Ulcerous Uragnite and A Beaked Blusterer completed (GMs): two of three: nothing. A
# Man-eating Mite completed: 341, finished: completed (no reward). Joachim (completed): no section: nothing.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/340 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/341
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.AnUlcerousUragnite accepted
